>Number:         43654
>Category:       alpha
>Synopsis:       rl(8) driver causes unaligned access trap on alpha
>Confidential:   no
>Severity:       serious
>Priority:       medium
>Responsible:    freebsd-alpha
>State:          open
>Quarter:        
>Keywords:       
>Date-Required:
